  converged database is inherited, adjacency-changing online endpoints bump
  their local sequence and install the new LSA, recovering nodes continue the
  sequence from their own history, and every other router (including the
  endpoints' neighbors) keeps its old view.  Down routers originate nothing,
  hold no database and neither send nor receive.
